#18600
The Gates of the Adventurer's Academia~
A broad stone arch marks the public entrance to the Adventurer's Academia, a respected school
maintained in partnership with Midgaard's Adventurer's Guild. Carved shields, lanterns, spellbooks,
and crossed roads decorate the gatehouse, representing the many paths an adventurer may follow.
Beyond the arch lie halls where novices learn the practical habits that keep explorers alive, while
the road back toward Midgaard remains open to the west.
