#18602
The Hall of Observation~
Display cases, plaques, racks, and small curios line this carefully arranged hall. Nothing here is accidental. Each object has been chosen to reward a curious eye, encouraging students to LOOK closely and EXAMINE details rather than rushing past them. A closed practice door to the south leads toward a hands-on lesson, while the main corridor continues east and west.
~
