#18603
The Wayfinder's Nexus~
Four routes meet beneath a vaulted ceiling painted with a great compass rose. Each arch bears a different Academia emblem: a lantern for exploration, a blade for martial study, an open book for learned arts, and a bootprint for fieldcraft. The chamber is designed as a memorable landmark, teaching students to navigate by places and features instead of blindly following directions.
~
