#18604
The Passage of Preparation~
This narrow, orderly passage joins the Grand Rotunda to the practical classrooms below. Hooks for cloaks, weapon pegs, and small shelves line the walls, while a wooden door to the south bears a painted mortar-and-pestle. A carved maxim above the lintel reads, 'Prepare before danger, not during it.'
~
