#18605
The Practice Pit~
A circular sand-floored pit lies beneath the instructional halls, enclosed by waist-high stone walls and a locked training grate above. Blunted weapon marks scar several practice posts around the edge. This is where novices learn that combat is a choice with consequences: judge an opponent, watch your health, know when to flee, and recover before pressing deeper.
~
