#18606
The Hall of Doors and Keys~
Several different doors, latches, locks, and barred panels have been built into this compact training room. At its center, a reinforced grate covers a ladder descending to the Practice Pit. Brass plaques explain that adventurers are expected to understand how to OPEN, CLOSE, LOCK, and UNLOCK obstacles, and to pay attention to the keys and mechanisms they encounter.
~
