#18607
The Hall of Arms~
Weapon racks line the walls beneath painted diagrams showing safe grips and common fighting stances. The Academia keeps simple practice weapons here so novices can learn to GET, WIELD, HOLD, REMOVE, and inspect their EQUIPMENT before facing real danger. The room is functional rather than grand, with every rack labeled and every blade deliberately dulled for instruction.
~
