#18608
The Field Gate~
Fresh air moves through a broad stone gate opening toward the road outside the Academia. Practice markers and low hurdles stand in a grassy enclosure just beyond the walls, where instructors teach students to transition from controlled lessons to the uncertainty of the wider world. The main instructional route continues east, while the northern way returns to the road near Midgaard.
~
