#18609
The Quartermaster's Passage~
Heavy shelves and orderly storage alcoves turn this corridor into an extension of the Academia quartermaster's stores. Bundles of rope, bedrolls, spare lanterns, chalk, waterskins, and battered training gear demonstrate the unglamorous tools that keep expeditions alive. The hall runs between the Field Gate and the quieter recovery rooms.
