#18611
The Hall of Equipment~
Armor stands and labeled mannequins occupy this corner of the instructional wing. Each display demonstrates a different worn location, from head and body to wrists, hands, legs, and feet. Students are encouraged to compare INVENTORY with EQUIPMENT and learn how to WEAR and REMOVE gear before trusting their lives to it.
