#18612
The Alchemical Classroom~
Shelves of harmless reagents, stoppered bottles, dried herbs, and stained worktables fill this warm classroom. Chalk diagrams explain the safe handling of potions, food, drink, lights, and other consumables an adventurer may rely upon in the field. A broad stair descends toward the Practical Examination Grounds, while doors return to the surrounding halls.
~
