The Hall of Founders~
A dignified chamber honors the explorers, healers, scholars, scouts, and sellswords who established the Adventurer's Academia. A central statue depicts an unnamed adventurer holding a lantern forward rather than raising a weapon, symbolizing curiosity guided by judgment. Passages lead toward the grand stairs and the academic halls.
