#18641
The Gallery of Adventurers~
Painted panels, expedition maps, retired banners, and framed copies of famous contracts line this long gallery. The displays celebrate not only victories but rescues, discoveries, recovered histories, and expeditions that wisely turned back. The Academia makes its values clear: a successful adventurer is more than a killer.
~
