#18642
The Grand North Stair~
A sweeping marble stair rises beneath the northern half of the Academia's great dome. Balustrades carved with lanterns and laurel leaves frame the ascent to an observation balcony, while the Grand Rotunda opens to the south and the Gallery of Adventurers lies west.
