Northern Observation Balcony~
The northern balcony curves around the great dome and looks across fields, roads, and distant high ground beyond Midgaard. Brass viewing plates identify several routes used by merchants, patrols, and adventuring companies. Tutors bring students here to remind them that maps, roads, weather, and preparation matter long before steel is drawn.
