#18644
The Hall of Arcane Studies~
Silver-inlaid circles, slate boards, warded practice alcoves, and shelves of copied spell theory fill this bright academic hall. Students with magical disciplines learn how to review their SPELLS, manage mana, PRACTICE their arts, and CAST responsibly. Those without spellcasting are still welcome, for recognizing magic is often as important as wielding it.
~
