The Grand Rotunda~
The heart of the Adventurer's Academia rises beneath a high painted dome. Twin staircases climb to observation balconies while academic halls branch east and west. Students, instructors, messengers, and Guild representatives pass beneath hanging banners representing many adventuring traditions. This is where the separate lessons of the Academia are brought together into a single idea: prepare well, think clearly, and return alive.
~
